 nose than Pentex, but then what isn't?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T04:31:49-08:00","id":1422583,"title":"","content":"Meh, Walt Disney being part of the New World Order in oWoD isn't surprising to me. Even in our IRL reality he's really suspicious and many of his media over the years have been tome'd for subliminal messaging of somesort. His company is also a whole conglomeration that owns multiple media houses and IPs too. There is also the whole &quot;Illuminati&quot; spiel that has always been floated around for years too. Walt being an NWO in oWoD is immersive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T08:34:25-08:00","id":1422598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1422398-other-barons-of-los-angeles?p=1422451#post1422451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's interesting and very good subtext that Isaac Abrams is the Baron in Chief and all the other Barons answer to him as well as get their territory from him.<br /> <br /> In other words, LA is just a Princedom with a Primogen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey whatever happened to Christopher Houghton? As I recall, he is the most powerful 'Anarch' in Los Angeles, and possibly in the world. Or am I misremembering?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25604-nuclearsnake","name":"NuclearSnake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25604_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T09:38:52-08:00","id":1422609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuclearSnake</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1422398-other-barons-of-los-angeles?p=1422598#post1422598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hey whatever happened to Christopher Houghton? As I recall, he is the most powerful 'Anarch' in Los Angeles, and possibly in the world. Or am I misremembering?</div> </div> </div> </div>If he's there, he's keeping a low profile. There's no mention of him in VTMB1 or the web series.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reac